OL,3,GNEWSA'Living next door to anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour has been hell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor seven years James Daniel has been
OL,7,Fliving next to successive "nightmare
OL,8,Fneighbours". Despite numerous
OL,9,Fcomplaints to various agencies,
OL,10,Fincluding his housing association, he
OL,11,Fsaid his situation had not improved.
OL,13,FIt comes as new data from the Housing
OL,14,FOmbudsman showed a rise over five years
OL,15,Fin the number of complaints upheld
OL,16,Fabout social landlords' handling of
OL,17,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
