OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Living next door to anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour has been hell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Devon and Cornwall Police has
OL,7,Fincreased the number of closure orders
OL,8,Fplaced on residential properties,
OL,9,Fhousing associations report that
OL,10,Fdealing with anti-social behaviour can
OL,11,Fbe a complex issue and requires working
OL,12,Fclosely with other agencies.
OL,14,FDaniel said he had spent years
OL,15,Freporting the alleged anti-social
OL,16,Fbehaviour and collecting evidence,
OL,17,Fincluding security camera and mobile
OL,18,Fphone footage, which he passed on to
OL,19,Fthe police, North Devon Homes and now
OL,20,Fthe BBC.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
